<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-009" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:siblings" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:siblings:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">王丞相</persName>二弟不過江，曰<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:siblings:m0010" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAB">頴</persName>，曰<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:siblings:m0013" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAC">敞</persName>。時論以<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:siblings:m0018" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAB">頴</persName>比<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:siblings:m0020" ref="ra9_tie_fu4">鄧伯道</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:siblings:m0024" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAC">敞</persName>比<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:siblings:m0026" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫忠武</persName>。議郎、祭酒者也。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:wangshipu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:wangshipu:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAB">潁</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:wangshipu:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAB">茂英</persName>，位至議郎，年二十卒。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:wangshipu:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAC">敞</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:wangshipu:m0017" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAC">茂平</persName>，丞相祭酒，不就。襲爵堂邑公，年二十有二而卒。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:zhongxing" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:zhongxing:m0000" ref="3c9_d1d_870">謐</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:zhongxing:m0002" ref="3c9_d1d_870">雅遠</persName>，丞相<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:zhongxing:m0007" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">導</persName>孫，車騎<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wangdao-relatives:zhongxing:m0012" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAE">劭</persName>子。有才器，襲爵武岡侯，位至司徒。</p>
</text>
